      "Thick, slightly grainy texture is a common buyer complaint",
      "Too many calories if you only wanted protein"
    ],
    "bottomLine": "The pick for parents who are skipping meals altogether in the newborn weeks and need calories as much as protein.",
    "specs": {
      "Protein per serving": "About 40 g per 90 g",
      "Calories": "About 400",
      "Third-party testing": "None we could confirm",
      "Best for": "Replacing a missed meal"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "thorne-whey-protein-isolate",
