      "No sport certification we could confirm",
      "Concentrate carries more lactose than an isolate",
      "About 20 g of protein at a mid-to-premium price; we could not confirm a stable list price"
    ],
    "bottomLine": "A good flavored choice if you want to keep artificial sweeteners out of your diet while nursing.",
    "specs": {
      "Protein per serving": "About 20 g (listing)",
      "Calories": "About 100",
      "Third-party testing": "USDA Organic; no sport certification confirmed",
